# Vue SFC discipline

Match the repository's Composition API vs Options API convention in new and
edited components. Do not mix styles in one file unless the file already does.

Reuse the existing store (Pinia, Vuex, or local state). Do not add Pinia when
Vuex already owns application state, and do not add Vuex when Pinia is in use.

Prefer existing UI kit components over one-off markup. Follow the project's
script setup and style-scoped patterns.
